o do muscle-strengthening activities at least twice a week.","wo":"War nga def muskulaasioŋ gën gaa néew ñaari yoon ci ayu-bis bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWar nga def musculation gueun ga néw gnari yone ci ayou biss bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2106,"row":{"en":"But if we had a spare million dollars, I guess it’s not the worst thing to spend it on.","wo":"Sudee am nga milioŋu dolaar boo denc, gis naa ni mën nga ko ci dugal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé am nga million dolaar bo denc, guiss na ni meun nga ko si dougal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2107,"row":{"en":"Once you've removed the tick, wash the area with soap and water.","wo":"Soo dindee kutt bi ba noppi, jëlal saabu nga raxas barab bi mu nekkoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo dindé kutt bi ba noppi dieulal sabou nga rakhass barab bi mou nékone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2108,"row":{"en":"Jesus is our heaven-sent, born-in-a-stable prophet, priest, and king.","wo":"Juddoo ci gétt, Jesus mooy sunu yonent, di pretre di buur.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDioudou si guétt, djésus moy sounou yonent, di pretre di bour.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2109,"row":{"en":"Turns out, he liked that album a lot and ended up buying a copy himself!","wo":"Dafa mujj bëgga albom bi ba sax mujje jëndal boppam benn kopi!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa moudj beuga albom bi ba sakh moudjé dieundal boppam benn kopi !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2110,"row":{"en":"Hockey is a fast-paced, physical sport that is played on ice.","wo":"Hockey, tàggat yaram la bu gaaw bu ñuy defee ci kaw glaas.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nHockey tagat yarame leu bou gaaw bougnouy défé ci kaw glaas\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2111,"row":{"en":"Vimes was having a headache.","wo":"Vimes daa àndoon ak bopp buy metti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nVimes da andone ak bopp bouy metti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2112,"row":{"en":"She's snapping at me all the time, and it's starting to take a toll on our relationship.","wo":"Daf may yuuxu saa yu nekk te loolu mingi bëgga yàq sunu diggante.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafmay youkhou sa you nek té lolou moungui beuga yak souniou diganté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2113,"row":{"en":"One day, Santiago sets out in his skiff and hooks a giant marlin.","wo":"Benn bis, Santiago tëmb ak gaalam, daal di jàpp jën wu mag.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss, santiago teumb ak gaalam, daldi diap dieun wou mag.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2114,"row":{"en":"In 1987, Sankara was assassinated in a coup d'état led by Blaise Compaoré.","wo":"Ci 1987, ci la Blaise Compaoré def coup detaa bi faat Sankara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi 1987, ci la Blaise Compaoré def coup d'état bi fate Sankara.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2115,"row":{"en":"The peculiar thing about a trauma anniversary is that you share it with someone horrible.","wo":"Li gëna doywaar ci fàttaliku mbir mu tiis lool ci xol, mooy danga koy bokk ak nit ku doy waar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi geuna doywar si fattalikou mbir mou tiss lool si khol moy dan ga koy bokk ak nitt kou doy war.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2116,"row":{"en":"Juan learned how to measure the ingredients, how to cook the meat, and how to assemble the tacos.","wo":"Juan jàng ni ñuy nattee mbir yi ciy dem, ni ñuy toggee yàpp, ak ni ñuy boolee tacos yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJuan diang ni gnuy naté mbir yi si dem, ni gnuy togué yap, ak ni gnuy boolé tacos yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2117,"row":{"en":"Performed firmware upgrade prior to starting hardware install.","wo":"Yeesal losisel bimu àndaaleel laata ngay tàmbali samp gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_