124,"row":{"en":"Yes, I could be hurt on tomorrow’s ride, but will that stop me?","wo":"Waaw, mënnamaa gaañu ci dawal gi suba, waaye ndax loolu dinamako tere def?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWaw meun nama gagnou si dawal gui souba wayé ndakh lolou dina mako teureu def ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2125,"row":{"en":"Molecular dynamics simulations of intestinal fatty acid-binding protein.","wo":"Similaasioŋu dinaamiku molekuleer bu proteine liyeesoŋu asid graa yi ci mbàq yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSimilaasion dynamique moleculaire bou proteine lyésone asid gras yi thi mbakh yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2126,"row":{"en":"Therapist: It sounds like this is a really difficult situation for you.","wo":"Terapist bi: Su dëgg rek taxee ñuy wax, li ngay dundu mettina ci yaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTerapist bi: Sou deug rek takhé niouy wakh, li ngay doundou metina si yaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2127,"row":{"en":"Sudan has a population of over 40 million people and a land area of over 1.8 million square kilometers.","wo":"Sudan amna askan wu ëpp 40 milioŋ ciy doomi aadama ak yaatuwaayu suuf su tollu ci 1.8 milioŋ ci kilometre kaare.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoudan amna askan wou eup 40 million si doomi aadama ak yaatuwaayou souf sou tollou si 1.8 million si kilomètre carré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2128,"row":{"en":"Within a week that earthquake would tear the thick temple curtain from top to bottom.","wo":"Fileek benn ayu-bis suuf siy yëngu dina xotti buntu temple bu dëll bi ci kaw ba ci suuf.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFilek bene ayou bisse souf si yeungue dina khotti bountou temple bou deull bi thi kaw ba thi souf.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2129,"row":{"en":"Animals may be beaten, kicked, burned, starved, or even killed for no reason other than human entertainment.","wo":"Kenn warul dóor