eum you rafet defar ay bayima ay garab ba si ay paysage.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2135,"row":{"en":"In one case, researchers were able to identify a soldier who had been missing for over 70 years using photos from a military archive.","wo":"Benn ci misaal yi, bi ñu jëfandikoo nataali soldaar yooyu, ci la gëstukat yi xàmmee soldaar bu kenn xamulwoon bu faatu lu weesu 70 at.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn ci misal yi, bignou dieufandiko natali soldat yoyou, ci la guestoukat yi khamé soldat bou kene khamoul wone bou fatou lou wessou 70 att.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2136,"row":{"en":"Ride a giant wolf spider for its climb speed, poison bite, and creep factor.","wo":"Warlen ab jargooñ-till bu mag ngir gaawaayam ci yeeg, matt mattam bu am dangaar, ak mëninam ci raam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWarlen ab djargogn till bou mag nguir gaawaayam thi yeug, matt mattam bou ame dangaar, ak meuninam thi raam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2137,"row":{"en":"She gave her two weeks' notice and started looking for a new job.","wo":"Mu daal di yëgal patroŋam ni dafa bàyyi fileek ñaari ayu-bis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou daldi yeugal patronam ni dafa bayi filek gnari ayou biss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2138,"row":{"en":"In some cases, kidney diseases can lead to kidney failure, which is a fatal condition.","wo":"Ci ñenn ñi, feebaru rein jur rein yu mënatul def seen liggéey, te loolu mën na faat nit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi gnene gni feebaru rein diour rein you meunatoul def seen liguey té lolou meun na fat nitt.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2139,"row":{"en":"But I never wanted to live that kind of life.","wo":"Waaye musu ma bëgga dundu boobu xeetu dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé meusouma beuga doundou bobou kheutou doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2140,"row":{"en":"Easy to use, all you have to do is push down on the bait cup and twist it one-quarter of the way around.","wo":"Yomb naa jëfandikoo, li ngay def lu lenn ludul tëye koppu bi nga xaw turne tuuti mu wàcci.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYomb na dieufandiko li ngay def lou lene loudoul teuye koppu bi nga khaw tourné touti mou wathié.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2141,"row":{"en":"I am particularly interested in the ways in which French has been influenced by other languages, such as Latin, Germanic languages, and Arabic.","wo":"Lima ma gënoon soxal mooy wane ni làkku français nekkee royuwaay ci yeneen làkk yi, lu ci melni Latin, làkki Germanic, ak Araab.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima ma geuneu sohal moy wané ni lakou francais néké royouway si yénéne lak yi, lou si melni latin, lakki germanic ak arab.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2142,"row":{"en":"The sclera is the white part of the eye, the choroid is the dark layer behind the sclera, and the retina is the light-sensitive layer at the back of the eye.","wo":"Sclera mooy wàll wu weex wi ci bët bi, choroide mooy wàll wi ñuul ci bët bi, retine bi wàll wiy kapte leeraay bi te nekk ci ginaw bët bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSclera moy wall wou wekh wi thi beut bi, choroide moy wall wi gnoull ci beut bi, retine bi wall wiy kapte leeraay bi te neuk ci guinaw beut bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2143,"row":{"en":"The kinetic connection of fingers, hand, arm, brain, and heart releases whatever truth lies waiting to be told.","wo":"Lëkkaloo gi am ci diggante baraami loxo yi, loxo bi, xel mi, ak xol ñooy génne dëgg gi bëggoon ñu wax ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLeukaloo gui am thi diganté barami lokho yi, lokho bi, hel mi ak khol gnoy guéné deugue gui beugone gnou wakh ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2144,"row":{"en":"Lyme disease is a serious illness, but it can be treated with antibiotics.","wo":"Feebaru Lyme, feebar bu tar la, waaye mën nañu ko fajee àntibiotik.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFeebaru lyme feebar bou tar la wayé meun nagnou ko fadjé antibiotik.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2145,"row":{"en":"Some of the most important historical figures in Malawi include David Livingstone, John Chilembwe, and Hastings Kamuzu Banda.","wo":"Ñenn ñi gëna am solo ci taarixu Malawi ñooy ñu melni David Livingstone, John Chilembwe, ak Hastings Kamuzu Banda.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnén gni geuna ame solo si taarikhou Malawi gnoy gnou melni David Livingstone, John Chilembwe, ak Hastings Kamuzu Banda.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2146,"row":{"en":"Visitors can find a bargain on everything from clothes to souvenirs.","wo":"Ku fa dem mën nga fa amee mbir yu yomb may yéere wala souvenir.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou fa dem meun nga fa amé mbir you yombe may yéré wala souvenir.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2147,"row":{"en":"He was amazed by all the different things he saw, from ancient artifacts to modern art.","wo":"Dafa yéemu ci mbir yu bari te wuute yi mu gis, dalee ko ci yi fi maam bawoon ba ci art bu bees bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa yeumou thi mbir you bari té wouté yi mou guiss, dalé ko thi yifi mame bawoone ba thi art bou bess bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2148,"row":{"en":"What are we going to do? I ask.","wo":"Ma laaj, waa leegi lu nuy def?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa ladj wa legui lougnouy def ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2149,"row":{"en":"Once the vessel is built, a new certificate of registration without this phrase and restriction can be obtained.","wo":"Su daajee gaal gi ba noppi, dina ñu mëna am sertifikaa dimatrikulaasioŋ bu bees bu amul tere yii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou dadjé gaal gui ba noppi dina gnou meuna ame certificat dimatriculation bou bess bou amoul tér