 patron wala patronou immeuble bi aarou gnou si loragne gui nitt ki mom togn boppam\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2156,"row":{"en":"She was last seen on February 25th, leaving her apartment in the city's Notting Hill neighborhood.","wo":"Ñu ngi ko mujjee gis bisu 25 fewriye, bàyyi apartment bi mu yor ci boori Notting Hill bi ci dëkk bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou ngui ko moudié guiss bissou 25 fewriyé, bayi appartement bi mou yorr thi boori Notting Hill bi thi deuk bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2157,"row":{"en":"When you make healthy choices for your health and fitness, you are not only improving your own life, but you are also setting a positive example for others.","wo":"Soo jëlee dogal yu wér ni yaa ngir sa wérgi-yaram ak fitness, yamoo ci defar sa dundu rek, waaye yaa nekk royukaay bu baax ci ñeneen ñi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo dieulé dogal you wér ni ya nguir sa wérgui yaram ak fitness, yamoo si defar sa doundou rek wayé ya neuk royoukay bou bakh si gnénéne gni.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2158,"row":{"en":"She didn't know what to do.","wo":"Xamul woon lumu wara def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamoul wone loumou wara def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2159,"row":{"en":"fortunately","wo":"ci anam bu neex","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nthi anam bou nekh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2160,"row":{"en":"Ditch those manual processes and secure your labor workflow with a cloud-based crew management platform.","wo":"Xallal yooyu ligéeyu loxo ngir mëna téye sa taxawaayu ligéey ci ap bankaasu cloud.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhallal yoyou ligueyou loxo nguir meuna téyé sa takhawayou liguey thi ap bankassou cloud.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2161,"row":{"en":"In the afternoon, people may take a break from work to relax or socialize.","wo":"Su ngoon jotee, mën nañu noppalu ngir dallu wala saafoonte.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou ngone dioté meun nagnou noppalou nguir dalou wala saafoonté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2162,"row":{"en":"Mary's story is a reminder that art can be a powerful tool for expression.","wo":"Jaar-jaaru Mary daf nuy fàttali ni art jumtukaay la bu am doole buy jàllale yëg-yëg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiarou diarou Mary dafgnouy fattali ni art djumtoukay la bou am dolé bouy dialalé yeug yeug.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2163,"row":{"en":"But his supporters refuse to believe that Beauford is to blame.","wo":"Waaye soppey Beauford mënu nangu ni moo taañ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé soppéy beauford meunou nangou ni mo tagn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2164,"row":{"en":"* Drink plenty of water: Water is essential for healthy skin, as it helps to keep your skin hydrated and soft. Aim to drink eight glasses of water per day.","wo":"* Naanal ndox mu bari: Ndox mooy dundal der, ndax moo koy jox limu soxla ngir mëna tooy ak nooy. Fexeel naan juróom ñatti kaasu ndox bis bu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNaanal ndokh mou bari: Ndokh moy doundal der, ndakh mo koy diokh limou sokhla nguir meuna toy ak noy. Fekhel nane diourom gnatti kaassou ndokh biss bou nek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2165,"row":{"en":"one language is never enough","wo":"benn làkk du doy mukk","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn lakk dou doy mouk\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2166,"row":{"en":"It is going to give you such an immense reward, such tremendous satisfaction as an artist.","wo":"Dafa nara nekk mbégte bu rëy ci artist bi, lépp ndax liggéey bu baax bimu def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa nara nekk mbegte bou reuy si artiste bi, lepp ndakh liguey bou bakh bimou def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2167,"row":{"en":"He closed his eyes and savored the mome